OL,3,AThe hidden daytime dance revolution -
OL,4,Aand the man who captured it on camera
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor decades, photographer Tim Smith's
OL,7,Fimages of Bradford's British Asian
OL,8,F"daytimers" dance scene remained
OL,9,Flargely unseen. Now, some of those
OL,10,Fshots are taking their place in a major
OL,11,FTate exhibition examining the
OL,12,Fcreativity and rebellion that
OL,13,Ftransformed 1990s Britain.
OL,15,FOn a bright afternoon in Bradford,
OL,16,Fshoppers moved through the city centre
OL,17,Fcarrying bags, going about their day.
OL,19,FBehind a nearby doorway, another side
OL,20,Fof Bradford was pulsing to a very
OL,21,Fdifferent rhythm.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
