OL,3,AThe hidden daytime dance revolution -
OL,4,Aand the man who captured it on camera
OL,5,
OL,6,FTim Smith remembers stepping out of a
OL,7,Fsmall nightclub beneath the Alhambra
OL,8,Ftheatre after spending hours
OL,9,Fphotographing a "daytimers" disco.
